    "role": "Qliphothic Golem (Nahemoth — Greater)",
    "tier": 3,
    "factionId": "",
    "notes": "<p>The apex of Nahemoth's influence: a hulking twelve-foot golem of dripping molten gold, priceless gems and ancient coins embedded in its mass, faint screaming faces swirling just beneath the surface. Formed in the heart of cursed hoards where kings and oligarchs died alone with their wealth, it is an amalgam of the treasure and the souls enslaved to acquire it. Pure inertia and possessiveness — it exists to guard its hoard, and it counts you as inventory the moment you look at it wanting.</p><p><strong>Qliphah:</strong> Nahemoth, the Whispering Ones — the Hull of Malkuth. Avarice with a body count, wearing the body count.</p><p><em>Mal's note: 'Yes, it is LITERALLY made of money. That thought is its first attack. Notice it worked on you.'</em></p>",
